  <scopecontent id="d83a14a8d8ca12a064f19df3d754b8d6">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>Each card provides the personal or institutional name, applicable dates, and summary of correspondence. Many cards also provide an address for return correspondence and "see" references to the applicable file names within the NAR personal papers. Cards are often two-sided, with information documented on both sides.</p><p>A person or institution is initially documented with one card per person/institution. Additional cards are added when multiple entries have filled the first card, with long-term interactions represented by multiple cards.</p>  </scopecontent>
  <arrangement id="7716ff2153a8fd4761400c3e6c723508">
    <head>Arrangement</head>
<p>As received. Primarily alphabetical by personal or institutional name.</p>  </arrangement>
